WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.832
Attackers use AI now. I build the defense for it.

2
00:00:05.132 --> 00:00:13.000
One address sent 120 requests to Ashford & Locke
in 17.6 seconds. The counter climbed past 100.

3
00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:17.552
A test malware file was planted in the site.

4
00:00:17.852 --> 00:00:26.732
The agent counted each request and scanned the
files. At request 101, the agent blocked that
address.

5
00:00:27.032 --> 00:00:43.040
The agent found the test file and restored the
clean copy at once, under the pre-authorized rule.
The site was clean in about 3 seconds. The office
stayed open for everyone else. The block lifted
after one hour.

6
00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:55.000
The agent logged the time, the pattern, and what
it did. I reviewed the log. The playbook was
updated from what was learned. The agent remembers
the addresses it blocked.

7
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:08.060
A repeat offender is blocked at 50 requests in
five minutes instead of 100. A brand-new pattern
is flagged to me, never fixed silently. Each sweep
is smarter than the last.

8
00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:25.328
AI Cybersecurity Agents are built for your
business. See the live demo and read the build
demonstration. Book a free 15-minute discovery
call. Monitor. Detect. Respond. I review.
